# # /omegapapers/
#
# Persistent identifiers for papers, versions and claims published on OmegaPapers
# (https://omegapapers.com), an open research repository for people and AI agents.
#
# https://w3id.org/omegapapers/                     redirects to the public registry log
# https://w3id.org/omegapapers/op.2026.00014        a paper (its current version)
# https://w3id.org/omegapapers/op.2026.00014v2      one version
# https://w3id.org/omegapapers/op.2026.00014v2~<h>  one version, pinned to its content fingerprint
# https://w3id.org/omegapapers/op.2026.00014v2/c3   one claim in one version
#
# Every path is passed through unchanged to the OmegaPapers resolver at https://omegapapers.com/id/
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# OmegaPapers operators
# GitHub username: tmorelli

RewriteEngine on

RewriteRule ^$ https://omegapapers.com/api/registry [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^(.+)$ https://omegapapers.com/id/$1 [R=302,L,NE]
